---
title: Disclosure
permalink: /disclosure/
description: Who drafted and reviewed the instruments, each model's maker, and each maker's disclosed interest, quoted verbatim from the record.
---
<p>Everyone and everything that took part in drafting or reviewing the instruments is listed here. For each model, its maker is named. Each maker's disclosed interest is quoted <em>verbatim</em> from the file in the <a href="/record/">record</a> named in the last column; nothing is paraphrased.</p>
<table>
  <thead><tr><th scope="col">Role</th><th scope="col">Participant</th><th scope="col">Maker</th><th scope="col">Disclosed interest (verbatim)</th><th scope="col">Source</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {% for p in disclosure.participants %}
  <tr>
    <td>{{ p.role }}</td>
    <td>{{ p.name }}{% if p.note %} <small>({{ p.note }})</small>{% endif %}</td>
    <td>{{ p.maker or '—' }}</td>
    <td>{% if p.disclosed_interest %}<blockquote>{{ p.disclosed_interest }}</blockquote>{% else %}<em>Not yet quoted: the record containing this disclosure has not been added to the repository.</em>{% endif %}</td>
    <td>{% if p.source %}<a href="/record/{{ p.source }}">{{ p.source }}</a>{% else %}—{% endif %}</td>
  </tr>
  {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
<p>The models' makers did not take part and have not endorsed anything. A model's review is a record of what that model said when asked. The maintainer of this repository has no financial relationship with any of the makers; if that changes it will be recorded here and in the <a href="/changelog/">changelog</a>.</p>
